  "title": "关于订阅的更新/升级计划预告",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/avniQICDiZulItLovSTXuw",
  "publish_time": 1688135137,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "在不久的将来，我们的咖啡订阅计划会有以下更新\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n具体日期请耐心等待公众号推文～\n‍\n增加一年期订阅选项\n所有订阅会附带一个卡片，涵盖本期订阅豆的品相内容以及当前订阅是订阅周期里的第x期，以便于我们和客人双方来跟踪订阅计划的执行，卡片也可以用来收集\n订阅豆发文时会公布价格（正价）\n挂耳订阅会取消",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在不久的将来，我们的咖啡订阅计划会有以下更新\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          具体日期请耐心等待公众号推文～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            增加一年期订阅选项\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            所有订阅会附带一个卡片，涵盖本期订阅豆的品相内容以及当前订阅是订阅周期里的第x期，以便于我们和客人双方来跟踪订阅计划的执行，卡片也可以用来收集\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            订阅豆发文时会公布价格（正价）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            挂耳订阅会取消\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RiaAvB4Fhxk18lkzFUAxfltJT1I0oaYSb2NwVdKibbZHvmVt14ia60RQG5kK4AfFVx4FastBLPkxVKg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RiaAvB4Fhxk18lkzFUAxfltNU66XbQxvcoRdG9ahib6OEsCMrfAtV2k3KwmKFQF2Fdvj2LqhZ2A8Sw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n</img>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RiaAvB4Fhxk18lkzFUAxfltffjsOFkWKfmHIj4DJgDgJMiaGvQYxX2WYqyxgp2eH4LCgaLdJy17PYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RiaAvB4Fhxk18lkzFUAxfltFiaU6gKQO9XBkRdPOwLFBKCUIiaI8jicO7KLibiaFdicUFia6tNx7TKnNgoWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RiaAvB4Fhxk18lkzFUAxfltpLQjvpCSjXUyJJTcelEBcRicQyQJoL28jBxC71eYjFcx4Huic0G1Md6A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
